{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:27:27Z","created_by_operation":"op_a419f4105f054d0fb330d0a56b61a55e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_1bfab95d3d0ae3a1f1660d5025f44dfbf513c8689493388a6334c6aeb265e6b2","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"zhijiewong/openharness@2a7b7b8e1c0b snapshot 6e6c76904ecf371f","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_79137d89aa5603c0e0c7ac903cbf410bc75050783438c1f06fada1b3e95dfe1f","slc_b50e9c3a798dd016157d1178ad0fec2f442702984bf1cb59af1b70bf4dcef352"],"source_ids":["src_85932450c2dd523b82094e1cb8146f07"],"text":"The product ships 44 built-in tools across core file/shell operations (Bash, Read, Write, Edit, MultiEdit, Glob, Grep), web tools (WebFetch, WebSearch, ExaSearch), task tools, and agent tools (Agent, ParallelAgent, SendMessage), each labeled with a risk level.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:27:27Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a419f4105f054d0fb330d0a56b61a55e"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:27:27Z","created_by_operation":"op_a419f4105f054d0fb330d0a56b61a55e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_24f75da01a2dca101067440596d7fa2c02b632cbc8ad12d1bc5d63c964d60ec8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"zhijiewong/openharness@2a7b7b8e1c0b snapshot 6e6c76904ecf371f","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0d258665b215765b94b4a267cedd992001c421c3984d809f9b2ba38a687643c6","slc_35c4424d84340f59c499e7df4fbe972add5294bd77cbfa2a349daf8c05d61c2c","slc_9bf42d0640680bf334a7a6471a3085738d2094d17be4732673afdc4f8afd22e5"],"source_ids":["src_85932450c2dd523b82094e1cb8146f07"],"text":"Scheduled cron tasks are created via /cron commands with schedules like 'every 5m'; a background executor checks every 60 seconds for due tasks, runs them via sub-queries, and stores results in ~/.oh/crons/history/.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:27:27Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a419f4105f054d0fb330d0a56b61a55e"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:27:27Z","created_by_operation":"op_a419f4105f054d0fb330d0a56b61a55e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_4b026966063c841be8563b142340db25332ab4b85315e84fc42eb292d442f824","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"zhijiewong/openharness@2a7b7b8e1c0b snapshot 6e6c76904ecf371f","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_064710d45657407de6e59aa942cda2b03e394fad7a5c804149cb911f7978490a","slc_9efd4cfa2fa11eeb05a0bd3e656b8cad1588759b941de66e7cd42ee22123e266","slc_a629676918612bcf4115b96259621294ee1105c76ad88c18605362f913b9228e","slc_d809f11a64ef2b7e5e21cf343e10ac27ecd39cca5ff4c5a5c76aa9f097140dcc"],"source_ids":["src_85932450c2dd523b82094e1cb8146f07"],"text":"OpenHarness is a terminal AI coding agent installed via npm as @zhijiewang/openharness and launched with the `oh` command, with headless modes like `oh -p` and `oh run` for single-prompt CI/scripting use.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:27:27Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a419f4105f054d0fb330d0a56b61a55e"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:27:27Z","created_by_operation":"op_a419f4105f054d0fb330d0a56b61a55e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_582d0f9430f74999e36290f847ab6e98cae2be8e35736deafd34ffd873e13cb5","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"zhijiewong/openharness@2a7b7b8e1c0b snapshot 6e6c76904ecf371f","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_45bd2af7b9db34edaca9b6137c4bebb52d5aa03a7428644b1def2039a0d13a7f","slc_52d25f3bc4bf0f30b11974a8790f4730a6b5c02d74573d4b81a0907ec0919877","slc_c16feb820da9e407c8a57b010695e5e71ca59c3188794e1923082480e30e724f"],"source_ids":["src_85932450c2dd523b82094e1cb8146f07"],"text":"On session exit, memories not accessed in 30+ days lose 0.1 relevance per 30-day period, memories below 0.1 relevance are deleted, and consolidation is on by default (memory.consolidateOnExit).","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:27:27Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a419f4105f054d0fb330d0a56b61a55e"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:27:27Z","created_by_operation":"op_a419f4105f054d0fb330d0a56b61a55e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_6901a3eeeba93fd5f22256c8845e45193126359ecd6ee76efa0b8428af294142","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"zhijiewong/openharness@2a7b7b8e1c0b snapshot 6e6c76904ecf371f","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_b2fc123a96a88fc1f0e94f0f830b69e76c3b9f141435f9129cf6d520ac3286e0","slc_bbee7d053fff0ffd32c85b90b13218fbdd3254c26d3f7dd36ff17d16f758cca0"],"source_ids":["src_85932450c2dd523b82094e1cb8146f07"],"text":"Official Python (openharness-sdk via pip) and TypeScript (@zhijiewang/openharness-sdk) SDKs let programs drive `oh` with streaming events, stateful sessions, custom tools, permission callbacks, and session resume.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:27:27Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a419f4105f054d0fb330d0a56b61a55e"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:27:27Z","created_by_operation":"op_a419f4105f054d0fb330d0a56b61a55e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a2788287c7c4f8d571ba203bee6463cddffc0a05c8fb5ee286ad94ca1e07f265","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"zhijiewong/openharness@2a7b7b8e1c0b snapshot 6e6c76904ecf371f","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_604c4ecd469f136487ee717adda3d87f24a259c4d8ebbc3847d67fa0557b3490","slc_79137d89aa5603c0e0c7ac903cbf410bc75050783438c1f06fada1b3e95dfe1f"],"source_ids":["src_85932450c2dd523b82094e1cb8146f07"],"text":"The project targets Node.js 18+ with strict TypeScript, and the ACP integration depends on @agentclientprotocol/sdk as an optionalDependency that exits with an install hint if absent.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:27:27Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a419f4105f054d0fb330d0a56b61a55e"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:27:27Z","created_by_operation":"op_a419f4105f054d0fb330d0a56b61a55e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a4d8a6570f50e75501ab73af4c19f553aedc80216a843e8f7e13b1461b8cd1b7","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"zhijiewong/openharness@2a7b7b8e1c0b snapshot 6e6c76904ecf371f","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_935a96069d19933fc694fd48d2c8f82119056c64828ce50b80f3a17a4a642e91","slc_984825ca81774df0c9ffd960c816848ef86aca1067431b25120fa2e7133638e5","slc_fa43056b51746d6a12cfce5cbc7e17481028967c98ea578dc5065029d506a446"],"source_ids":["src_85932450c2dd523b82094e1cb8146f07"],"text":"Sub-agent permission isolation: an Agent call's permission_mode override can only narrow the parent's mode, and less-restrictive requests are silently clamped; read-only roles like code-reviewer and security-auditor default to plan mode.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:27:27Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a419f4105f054d0fb330d0a56b61a55e"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:27:27Z","created_by_operation":"op_a419f4105f054d0fb330d0a56b61a55e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c66d7969cfda218bf332c0482949fe05d97d87fc3114075bdb964b6f51e37037","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"zhijiewong/openharness@2a7b7b8e1c0b snapshot 6e6c76904ecf371f","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_24407f2051500881a8ec1355d068409c840fbbaa20aab4b8c83548a85f565243","slc_b4fbf93e5446be8e2344b292ff5da0ab7c328e1f5bf6778a6dae16d53d862603","slc_df688c418373b594d60d25f0ff08182e17d328fb5442044fec7bdbf181768b58"],"source_ids":["src_85932450c2dd523b82094e1cb8146f07"],"text":"Agent roles (code-reviewer, test-writer, debugger, architect, editor, etc.) restrict sub-agents to role-specific tool sets, and an architect→editor two-pass workflow routes to powerful/fast model tiers when modelRouter is configured.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:27:27Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a419f4105f054d0fb330d0a56b61a55e"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:27:27Z","created_by_operation":"op_a419f4105f054d0fb330d0a56b61a55e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ce4f6f84b207bf3f11471a53fdd220d2bd43b4c52a6090d36d0d9561f6e9ac32","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"zhijiewong/openharness@2a7b7b8e1c0b snapshot 6e6c76904ecf371f","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_604c4ecd469f136487ee717adda3d87f24a259c4d8ebbc3847d67fa0557b3490","slc_e7cdf49c42e605ebbfc5a2c1d5113dda82e3fcdce18c7984a4890fcfd2bf3a21"],"source_ids":["src_85932450c2dd523b82094e1cb8146f07"],"text":"An `oh acp` command speaks the Agent Client Protocol over stdin/stdout so ACP-capable editors (Zed, JetBrains via plugin, Cline, OpenCode) can drive the agent; permission prompts currently use OpenHarness's own flow rather than ACP's requestPermission path.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:27:27Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a419f4105f054d0fb330d0a56b61a55e"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:27:27Z","created_by_operation":"op_a419f4105f054d0fb330d0a56b61a55e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_df1e08f77300fa311a4c22cddae4357184c8557b375fcdcd4659444080ee71ea","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"zhijiewong/openharness@2a7b7b8e1c0b snapshot 6e6c76904ecf371f","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_584f2bddae6388dbeefa4be90453d264586616b408a5433430116f6661d9dadb","slc_93c4d0b92eb810404e08b473ada08c799f3cc69c8bc262874af3cd4e6626fdec","slc_dde448fc7028436b1247f6cee6dfe1612b48daf543db5d42a4e81251051b4830"],"source_ids":["src_85932450c2dd523b82094e1cb8146f07"],"text":"Permission modes include ask (default), trust, deny, acceptEdits, plan, auto, and bypassPermissions; low-risk read-only tools auto-approve while medium/high-risk tools require confirmation in ask mode, and Bash commands undergo AST-based destructive-pattern analysis.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:27:27Z","updated_by_operation":"op_a419f4105f054d0fb330d0a56b61a55e"}
